	"descriptionMarkdown": "Malakai Enterprises presents The Hauler!\n\nThis spacecraft is designed for large transport missions. The main focus of our engineers was to create a simple yet effective transport vessel, so it has 20 cargo bays and all the weapons needed to reach for the inner planets plus Aquilo. Energy is no problem, we provided a single nuclear reactor and four turbines for up to 24 MW of electric energy. Solar panels provide starting energy as well as emergency power.\n6 Thrusters allow for up to 210km/s of speed. It is slow, but the lack of speed is easily outweighed by its cargo capacity.\nThe ship can fully supply itself with fuel, turret ammunition and rockets. The only maintenance it needs is a supply of nuclear power cells, yet we recommend to have some ice available on the ship in case water is scarce.\nIt also shows you the status of both fuel and ammunition in red, yellow and green. When both bars are green, you are ready to go!\n\nWe from the Malakai Enterprises hope you enjoy this design and that it may help you on your journeys!\n(no refunds)\n\nNotes: We excluded all kinds of modules to account for early exploration needs, but we clearly recommend using speed modules for ammunition and fuel production!",
